1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:01,500
<i> So this is your issue,</i>

2
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:02,733
<i>- that she chose me, not you.
- Yes.</i>

3
00:00:02,867 --> 00:00:04,100
<i>Because if it were me,
I would never make her cry!</i>

4
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:05,767
<i>Don't you think
this is pointless?</i>

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,033
<i> Don't forget.</i>

6
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:09,100
<i> Jin Ho likes Joey.</i>

7
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:12,000
<i>You have every right
to be upset with me.</i>

8
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:13,967
<i> I hope you understand, Jin Ho.</i>

9
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,600
<i>I don't want to hurt you either.</i>

10
00:00:15,733 --> 00:00:17,500
<i> Hurry up and find Jin Ho.</i>

11
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:19,033
<i> Remember, he saw me.</i>

12
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:20,300
<i> I'm sorry, brother-in-law.</i>

13
00:00:20,433 --> 00:00:22,000
<i>Instead of helping them escape,</i>

14
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:23,633
<i>it looks like you only put them
in danger.</i>

15
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:26,067
<i>Someone saw Jin Ho's car
on the toll camera</i>

16
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,000
<i> in Sta. Monica.</i>

17
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:28,467
<i> Jin Ho! You okay?</i>

18
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,500
<i> Your wounds got infected!</i>

19
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:32,800
<i> Joey...</i>

20
00:00:32,933 --> 00:00:34,267
<i> Jin Ho...</i>

21
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:55,733
