22
00:00:58,367 --> 00:01:00,433
- [JIN HO GROANS SOFTLY]
- [ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

23
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:02,000
Joey...

24
00:01:05,133 --> 00:01:06,867
Jin Ho, did you drink?

25
00:01:10,567 --> 00:01:12,633
