[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

33
00:01:32,533 --> 00:01:33,833
Huh?

34
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:37,233
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

35
00:01:39,567 --> 00:01:42,333
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

36
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,167
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

37
00:01:48,733 --> 00:01:50,233
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

38
