40
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:57,000
Joey...

41
00:01:57,133 --> 00:01:59,300
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

42
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:01,133
Huh?

43
00:02:01,267 --> 00:02:03,333
[SPEAKING IN KOREAN]

44
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:07,100
Joahae.

45
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,833
Joahae.

46
00:02:10,967 --> 00:02:12,633
Joahae.

47
