trouble.

74
00:03:29,333 --> 00:03:32,067
So she wouldn't continue her
plan with Jin Ho.

75
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,667
I don't want her getting hurt
because of me.

76
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,300
Seriously!

77
00:03:36,433 --> 00:03:37,433
You're a journalist,

78
00:03:37,567 --> 00:03:39,067
