Oh, I'm sure now.

81
00:03:42,733 --> 00:03:46,500
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

82
00:03:46,633 --> 00:03:47,633
So once we find her,

83
00:03:47,767 --> 00:03:49,800
