- [SENTIMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]

87
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,500
You got high from the alcohol
and the medicine you took.

88
00:04:05,633 --> 00:04:07,433
This is your fault.

89
00:04:08,467 --> 00:04:09,833
Come on, let's just
talk tomorrow

90
00:04:09,967 --> 00:04:11,467
