91
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:14,367
- Joahae...
- Good night.

92
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:15,700
Good night.

93
00:04:15,833 --> 00:04:17,767
Joahae, joahae...

94
00:04:19,933 --> 00:04:21,567
Joahae...

95
00:04:23,667 --> 00:04:25,067
Go to sleep, okay?

96
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,667
Joahae...

97
00:04:27,367 --> 00:04:28,767
What is it with that joahae?

98
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,400
Joahae...

99
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:32,633
- Joahae...
- Good night already, Jin Ho.

100
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:34,900
Joahae...

101
00:04:35,433 --> 00:04:37,033
Joahae...

102
00:04:37,167 --> 00:04:41,533
[SENTIMENTAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

103
00:04:49,167 --> 00:04:51,933
This is the friend of Jin Ho
I was telling you about.

104
00:04:52,733 --> 00:04:54,100
There.

105
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,800
Hey, it's Boss Idol!

106
