Hey.

107
00:04:57,767 --> 00:04:58,767
Guys, it's Boss Idol.

108
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:00,467
- Hey, Boss Idol!
- Boss Idol!

109
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,400
- Boss!
- Hello, hello.

110
00:05:01,567 --> 00:05:03,200
You ended up here, Boss.

111
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:06,767
Ah, well, I just wanted to talk
to the owner.

112
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,933
Is there a problem?
- [INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

113
00:05:09,067 --> 00:05:11,233
Nothing really,
Peter just recommended

114
00:05:11,367 --> 00:05:17,833
so I wanted to present
my business proposal.

115
00:05:17,967 --> 00:05:20,533
They barely come here anymore
though.

116
00:05:20,933 --> 00:05:21,933
Just leave your number,

117
00:05:22,067 --> 00:05:23,933
