sensed something.

125
00:05:53,833 --> 00:05:56,833
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

126
00:05:56,967 --> 00:05:59,133
I don't need explanations.

127
00:06:01,667 --> 00:06:03,967
- I need results!
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

128
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:10,500
Because if that Jin Ho talks
and points at me,

129
00:06:10,667 --> 00:06:12,800
I'll cut your head off!

130
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,933
You know I dont make
empty threats, Liza.

131
00:06:17,067 --> 00:06:20,933
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

132
00:06:21,067 --> 00:06:22,600
Hurry up!

133
00:06:25,867 --> 00:06:27,800
I understand, Berdugo.

134
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,367
All right,
get out of here already!

135
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:35,533
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

136
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:47,333
