151
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,167
Then I'll wait too.

152
00:07:21,133 --> 00:07:22,300
You're so stubborn.

153
00:07:22,433 --> 00:07:26,767
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

154
00:07:42,633 --> 00:07:44,867
It's peaceful here, right?

155
00:07:46,033 --> 00:07:47,300
Yeah.

156
00:07:47,933 --> 00:07:50,167
Makes me not want to leave
this place anymore.

157
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:51,900
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

158
00:07:52,033 --> 00:07:54,500
Good thing you're feeling
better now.

159
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:56,233
Thanks to you.

160
00:07:56,367 --> 00:08:00,900
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

161
00:08:12,767 --> 00:08:14,233
Joey!

162
00:08:15,367 --> 00:08:16,767
Andrew?

163
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:21,233
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

164
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,933
