you say that.

170
00:08:42,933 --> 00:08:45,500
You already pushed her away.

171
00:08:45,633 --> 00:08:46,833
If you do it again,

172
00:08:46,967 --> 00:08:50,000
I won't stop her
from choosing me.

173
00:08:52,167 --> 00:08:54,167
That won't happen again.

174
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:58,300
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

175
00:09:03,367 --> 00:09:08,000
