176
00:09:08,133 --> 00:09:10,000
Hey.

177
00:09:10,133 --> 00:09:11,133
I felt that, huh.

178
00:09:11,267 --> 00:09:12,900
- Felt what?
- [STAMMERS]

179
00:09:13,033 --> 00:09:14,500
What are you even
I felt you doing something,

180
00:09:14,633 --> 00:09:17,000
