- You're disgusting, boy!

183
00:09:20,767 --> 00:09:22,433
- [CHUCKLES]
- What are you even saying?

184
00:09:22,567 --> 00:09:24,067
And I'm the disgusting one, huh.

185
00:09:24,967 --> 00:09:28,767
So that's why you don't like
Joey because you're confused?

186
00:09:29,867 --> 00:09:31,533
You're disgusting.
What are you talking about?

187
00:09:31,667 --> 00:09:32,700
[LAUGHS]

188
00:09:32,833 --> 00:09:34,467
It's okay, I understand.

189
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,833
It's okay.

190
00:09:37,733 --> 00:09:39,467
<i> You already pushed her away.</i>

191
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,567
<i> If you do it again,</i>

192
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:45,700
<i>I won't stop her
from choosing me.</i>

193
00:09:47,167 --> 00:09:48,467
That can't happen.

194
00:09:51,167 --> 00:09:53,900
Peter, we need to find Joey

195
00:09:54,033 --> 00:09:55,967
