196
00:09:56,100 --> 00:10:00,233
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

197
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:02,867
Who's that?

198
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,900
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

199
00:10:08,933 --> 00:10:10,233
Hey, hey, hey...

200
00:10:11,367 --> 00:10:13,067
Wait, isn't she the owner?

201
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,900
Isn't that her?

202
00:10:17,033 --> 00:10:19,400
- What?
- Yeah, I think that's Eun Ji.

203
00:10:19,533 --> 00:10:21,233
Come on, let's go to him.

204
00:10:23,667 --> 00:10:25,200
[CLATTERING IN DISTANCE]

205
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,333
[GROANS]

206
00:10:27,467 --> 00:10:31,200
[PLEASANT MUSIC PLAYING]

207
00:10:41,167 --> 00:10:44,300
Oh, Jin Ho,
you're awake already!

208
00:10:44,667 --> 00:10:46,167
- Good morning!
- Good morning.

209
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:48,300
Looks like you're feeling
better now, huh?

210
00:10:48,433 --> 00:10:50,567
Yeah, I feel much better now.

211
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:51,733
That's good.

212
00:10:51,867 --> 00:10:54,133
You know, good thing
you stocked up on antibiotics.

213
00:10:54,267 --> 00:10:57,067
I stocked up everything
I might need.

214
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:59,100
Ah, that's wise!

215
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,867
- You fetched water?
- [♪PLEASANT MUSIC PLAYING♪]

216
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,933
Yup!

217
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:09,933
Well, you might need it right
away.

218
00:11:10,067 --> 00:11:10,933
And not just one,

219
00:11:11,067 --> 00:11:12,067
