221
00:11:13,733 --> 00:11:15,967
But one of them is just for me.

222
00:11:16,100 --> 00:11:17,533
Don't touch that one, okay?

223
00:11:17,667 --> 00:11:18,833
Thank you, Joey.

224
00:11:18,967 --> 00:11:20,700
Oh, it's nothing.

225
00:11:20,833 --> 00:11:23,033
Friends take care
of each other, right?

226
00:11:23,167 --> 00:11:25,567
[PLEASANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

227
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:27,233
Oh, by the way.

228
00:11:27,367 --> 00:11:28,967
You never mentioned

229
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:30,200
