237
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:46,300
What's that?

238
00:11:46,433 --> 00:11:49,833
[LIGHT PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

239
00:11:49,967 --> 00:11:51,833
Ah...

240
00:11:52,433 --> 00:11:53,567
Joahae...

241
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:55,133
Ah...

242
00:11:55,267 --> 00:11:58,067
