243
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,167
Ah...

244
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,500
Thank you.

245
00:12:00,633 --> 00:12:02,400
- Yeah, thank you.
- Ah...

246
00:12:02,533 --> 00:12:04,300
