and over.

249
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,167
No, that's just thank you.

250
00:12:10,867 --> 00:12:12,200
Well...

251
00:12:12,333 --> 00:12:14,033
I should actually be
the one saying that

252
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,833
